      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Health Canada's method is a test of at least 91 days in the heating season, in the lowest room you actually live in. It's cheap, it's slow, and it's the only number worth making a decision on.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
